{"id":"2d6dc64668d77215","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-computable-isomorphism.md","title":"可计算置换与集合可计算同构","display":"df-computable-isomorphism — 可计算置换与集合可计算同构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-computable-isomorphism","aliases":["20-df-computable-isomorphism"],"display":"df-computable-isomorphism — 可计算置换与集合可计算同构","chapter":"1","section":"1.7","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definitions 1.7.1–1.7.2","source_pdf_pages":[55,56],"source_printed_pages":[19,20],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-computable-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-computable-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-isomorphism — 可计算置换与集合可计算同构"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definitions 1.7.1–1.7.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>55</span><span>56</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>19</span><span>20</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(p:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{CompPerm}(p)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\n\\forall y\\ \\exists!x\\ [p(x)=y],\\\\\nA\\cong_cB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists p\\ [\\operatorname{CompPerm}(p)\\land p[A]=B].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{CompPerm}(p)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\n\\forall y\\ \\exists!x\\ [p(x)=y],\\\\\nA\\cong_cB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists p\\ [\\operatorname{CompPerm}(p)\\land p[A]=B].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>可计算双射的逆通过搜索原像可计算。这里是集合的可计算同构，不是要求集合本身可计算。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 1.7.1–1.7.2；印刷页 19, 20；PDF 第 55, 56 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{CompPerm}(p)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ p\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\n\\forall y\\ \\exists!x\\ [p(x)=y],\\\\\nA\\cong_cB\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists p\\ [\\operatorname{CompPerm}(p)\\land p[A]=B].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":1388,"backlinks":[{"id":"0f325d95c7cd0f32","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"8bfbf07c0a7ee61b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"50ca9db6cf8f4a12","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。"},{"id":"7959e36d1026e950","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]；see [[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-injective-numbering-translation]]；see [[20-thm-generalized-myhill]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-isomorphism]] — 章 1；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]"}],"outgoing":["e343870c773cb68e"]}